    "text": "amazingmadison.com\nwebsite\nMadison\nDSU linebacker Cole Paulson named to Allstate Good Works Team\n15 hours ago\nAllstate, and the America Football Coaches Association, announced Tuesday a record-breaking 197 nominees for the 2025 Allstate AFCA Good Works Team®, the highest in the award’s 34-year history. College football student athletes and head coaches from all levels of the sport are recognized for their commitment to community service and leadership beyond the gridiron.",
